WEBVTT

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.290
Do you know about cats?

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:13.580
Cute ears that wiggle sensitively...

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.870
Tails that wag expressively,
responding to emotions...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.910
Attached to a bipedal creature
of the utmost charm...

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.660
Do you like cats like that?

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:29.910
If so, please visit this patisserie.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.700
The cutest cats you've
ever seen await you there!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.120
Welcome!

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.450
Welcome to La Soleil!

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.040
Oh?

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.500
Where did she go off to?

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:33.080
Where are you?

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:35.540
Come out, please. Don't hide.

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:41.200
What are you doing Shigure? It's still early.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:44.450
Well, I can't seem to find her.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:46.750
By "her," you mean her?

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.120
I thought she slept in your room last night.

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:50.660
Is she lost?

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:54.080
Huh? How does anyone get lost inside the house?

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.620
She's not you, you know.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:56.790
What?!

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.160
--Oh, you want some?
--You're going to feel the hurt.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.450
--Stop it, that's no way to start the day.
--You're going to feel the hurt.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:01.000
--Stop it, that's no way to start the day.
--Huh? You're just bigger--nothing to it.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.830
--You two really have a lot of energy.
--Huh? You're just bigger--nothing to it.

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.620
--You two really have a lot of energy.
--How can I lose to you?

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.200
You really are loud for someone so small!

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:12.540
What is it?

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.750
Wh-What are you doing there...?

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:22.540
I guess the toilet seat is really warm...

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:30.790
I wonder if she's eating right now?

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.580
Hmm? What is it?

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:39.790
That's not jam; that's soy sauce-boiled laver.

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:46.080
You're so clumsy so early. So cute.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:50.660
Th-This isn't me being clumsy!
This is super delicious!

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.330
The way you make excuses is cute, too.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:59.700
Wait, this really is delicious!

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.620
I didn't expect that plot twist...

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:08.580
Did she brush her teeth properly?

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:09.580
Chocola.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.330
--Huh?
--That...

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.410
"Changing now"
I shouldn't worry. Shigure-<i>chan </i>is there,
and so is everyone else.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:20.540
I shouldn't worry. Shigure-<i>chan </i>is there,
and so is everyone else.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:23.870
I'm not worried at all, not one bit.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:26.910
She's just... slightly on my mind.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:32.410
I'm more worried about Chocola...

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.160
H-Huh?!

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.830
Are you really that worried about her?

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:45.040
Where is your house?

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:47.750
What's your name?

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:56.450
We never actually found out what her name was.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:02.540
Hey, Sugarcane! Make sure to
wash your hands before you eat!

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.000
"Sugarcane"?

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:08.580
Her name. It's inconvenient
to not have a name, right?

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:14.540
Convenient or not, you should at least
put effort into giving her a decent name...

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:18.040
"How to name a baby kitten, naming"
"How to name a baby kitten"
"Cat names ranking"
"How to name a baby kitten"...?

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:20.040
Oh, a baby...

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:25.790
Meaning, p-pistil and stamen,
nine months gestation...

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.450
What are you filling your head with
first thing in the morning?

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:34.700
Stop. You're a bad influence on the kitten.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:37.040
Don't look, don't listen, Sugarcane!

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:42.500
No, Azuki. You must not give her
a name without permission.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:46.660
If she is a lost kitten,
she must have a real name.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:50.540
Also, put your phone away when eating, Maple.

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:52.700
That's impolite.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.790
Yes, sit there.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:59.160
Who's a good kitty? Who's a good kitty?

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.950
Okay, everyone, all together.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:05.450
Let's eat.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.040
--Let's eat.
--Let's eat.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:17.330
Oh? Where has she gone off to?

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:24.950
Wh-When did she...?

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:31.040
Good work, both of you.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:33.370
We'll take over--take a break.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.790
Oh, Azu-<i>nyan</i>, Coco-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:38.700
Um... How is she doing?

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:42.500
She? Oh, Sugarcane.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.330
"Sugarcane"?

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:49.700
Hey, Azuki. Shigure-<i>sama </i>told you
not to name her without permission.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:54.250
She's doing fine, by the way.
Ate a full breakfast, no problem.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:58.410
She does have a habit of disappearing and
reappearing somewhere incredible, though.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:01.620
I know! She's so delusive!

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.540
I think you mean "elusive."

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:09.620
Well, it's fine. She doesn't cry
or cause trouble. No effort required.

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.750
I see...

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:14.660
Well, I'm glad she's doing well!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:20.290
She likes dried fish, so she'll appreciate it
if you give her some as a snack.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.120
Ah, I see.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.660
I'll try sometime.

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:27.830
Right, so for now,

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:31.950
there are no mentions of lost cats
matching her description.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:33.790
Thank you very much.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.250
Let's see... Lost cats, lost cats...

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.620
"Lost cats, search request, rescue cats"
"Lost cat info"
"Lost cat message board"
Let's see... Lost cats, lost cats...

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.910
"Lost cat info"
Let's see... Lost cats, lost cats...

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:46.500
I gotta be sharp--I'm the big sister now!

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:49.620
I've gotten used to the job now.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:51.080
I can handle this!

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:11.660
I-I'm such a bad big sister...

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:18.120
Hey, Nuts, go grab some
to-go boxes from the back.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:20.410
I need all sizes.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.660
They're heavy, so be careful!

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:25.450
Yeah! You can count on me for heavy lifting!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:30.080
Always needing help, that one.

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:34.410
Well, back to work for me, too, I guess.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:40.160
Thank you for waiting!

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:48.450
Two season's special short cakes,
one cherry cassis cheesecake,

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:50.040
three crème brûlées...
Six items comes out to...

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.370
"Credit 1"
"Credit 2"
three crème brûlées...
Six items comes out to...

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:53.250
"Total 2,200 Yen"

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.870
Two thousand, two hundred yen.

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:58.000
Wow!

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.410
Thank you, come again!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:03.080
Azuki is awesome as usual.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:05.870
She is the Minaduki family's
elder cat, after all.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.040
She has a huge experience point pool.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:13.540
Jeez, this shop really makes its cats work hard.

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:17.290
Azuki, I refilled the to-go boxes.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:19.290
Oh, thanks.

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:23.080
There seems to be fewer customers now,
want me to help out here?

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:26.540
There's nothing out here that needs help.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:33.000
You're just a kitten.
Don't stretch yourself too thin.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:38.580
Hmm. Look who's stretching now, huh, Azuki?

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:39.580
Huh?!

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.500
Th-This is...

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:46.040
Come on, don't be stubborn
and just ask for help.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.290
Shut up, you--!

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.540
Well, go ahead, then,
see if you can reach.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:03.160
Don't worry about them;
that's business as usual.

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:04.330
No problem.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.950
Today, we're at the popular aquarium!

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:11.370
Let's go inside!

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:14.870
Wow, so pretty!

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.870
Are you hungry?

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:22.160
Good timing. It's three o'clock, let's have tea.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:30.040
Wow, May-<i>chan</i>, this is quite impressive.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:32.910
They say the first time
is the most important, right?

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.910
I have to make sure to teach her what's good.

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:39.160
I see. Well, I'll help myself, then.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.330
Hold on!

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:41.500
Huh?

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.160
Darjeeling is one of the three
great teas of the world.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.410
It's best to drink it straight.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:50.410
Assam for milk, and this is Earl Grey.

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:54.250
Umm... May-<i>chan</i>, what are you doing?

00:10:54.250 --> 00:11:00.000
Like I said, the first time is important.
Elite training, I guess.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:05.370
"Maple's Tea Lesson"
Look. To make delicious tea,
you need to mind the water temperature.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:07.750
Boil fresh water at 100 degrees,

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:12.200
and pre-pour some hot water into the cups
and pots to warm them up.

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:16.500
Put in the tea leaves, pour the boiled water,
and let it sit for a moment.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:19.290
Take care not to let the temperature drop.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.660
I guess that's it for now.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.000
Huh...?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.450
Hmm?

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:32.160
"Dried Fish"

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:45.080
Oh, there you are.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:49.870
You prefer that over the afternoon tea
setup we prepared for you?

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:53.950
Well, you know what they say,
different strokes for different cats.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.910
Oh, good, she seems to like it.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.290
I don't know what to say.

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:08.700
You like it?

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:14.250
Good, good.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:23.910
Had enough? That's super high-class,
ordered by Shigure-<i>chan</i>.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:34.790
"Japanese Folk Tales"
A long time ago, there lived
an old man and an old woman.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.660
One day, the old woman...

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:38.700
I'm home, Mom!

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:41.000
Welcome home, Dad!

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:45.950
Would you like to eat first?
Bathe first? Or...

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.910
...me first?!

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:49.950
Come on!

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.370
Let's play!

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.910
See? Look, you jump like this!

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:03.660
It's tons of fun!

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:14.200
What are you doing, both of you?

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:20.950
She seemed lonely, so we thought
we should play with her.

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:24.500
But she wouldn't respond to anything...

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:29.370
Let's leave her alone for the moment.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:33.450
She just needs some more time, I think.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:48.370
Here are the toys the Minaduki family cats
have played with over the years.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:50.540
You can use whichever one you like.

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.120
Oh, that's an old favorite.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:04.620
Chocola played with it when she was small.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:30.700
Thank you for your purchase!

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:32.500
Please come again.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.910
Good work, both of you.

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:38.330
Well, we'll take off, then.

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:42.120
Hey, Azu-<i>nyan</i>! Um...

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:43.910
Hmm? What?

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:51.790
I-It's nothing, sorry. Thanks!

00:14:56.410 --> 00:15:00.660
Yes, it's fine! No problem.
She's fine, I'm sure.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:02.370
Okay, back to work, then!

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.540
I'm home.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.540
Hey, where's Sugarcane?

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:16.580
Come on, Azuki, what did I tell you
about giving a name without permission?

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:20.000
Please go get her, dinner is almost ready.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.370
Yes.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:26.870
Huh? She's not here...

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.290
That's odd.

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:37.330
I can't find her.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.540
Maybe she's outside the house.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:41.950
Let's all look for her together.

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:45.910
Hey, Sugarcane...

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:48.450
Where did you go?

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:52.450
It's dinner.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:54.330
Come back, please!

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:58.410
I have no choice but to use this...

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:03.160
Cats love <i>matatabi</i>!

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.160
Don't do it, Nuts!

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:06.790
Stop, that will...

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:16.200
That would happen, yes.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.080
Hello, this is Patisserie La Soleil.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:30.910
Hey, Shigure-<i>chan</i>. What's up?

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:32.000
Uh-huh.

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:40.830
What are you doing?!

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:44.000
Where do you think you're going?
We're still open.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.830
She, uh... She's missing, and...

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:50.120
...Shigure-<i>chan </i>said...

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:53.620
They looked all over the house,

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:58.450
her shoes are missing, too, so, like, um...

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.950
Yes, I understand.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:06.830
I can handle things here, you go look for her.

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:09.500
B-But the shop...

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.910
No problem--don't worry.

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:15.580
I can handle it alone.

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:18.160
We'll join you as soon as we close up here.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:21.080
Go, hurry.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:22.950
Thank you much, Vanilla!

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:25.370
Thank you so much, Master!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:34.000
Where are you?!

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:41.330
Where are you? Talk to me if you're here!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:45.120
Sugarcane!

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.910
Where did you go?

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:52.250
Hey, Nuts, you look over there.
I'll head that way.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.540
Got it.

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:59.290
W-Wait!

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:07.080
Oh, I-I'm sorry... Wrong cat.

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:11.750
Have you seen a kitten?

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:13.410
No...

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:16.330
She wears a hat, about this tall...

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:17.500
No...

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:24.080
What if she's lonely?

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:28.000
What if she's scared?

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:31.000
What if she's crying?

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.540
I have to find her...!

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:52.830
Not here...

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:14.000
I thought maybe she would be here, but...

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.500
Where did you go...?

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:18.620
Here.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:24.080
Wh-What?!

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:41.870
Come on, why did you disappear
on your own like that?!

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:45.870
We were so, so, so worried!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:53.950
With you.

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:55.160
Huh?

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.160
I want to be with you.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:19.580
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:22.450
You got us all worried!

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:25.910
I'm glad you weren't hurt or in an accident.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.290
Indeed.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:33.580
Well, it's late. Perhaps we should go.

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:39.750
Um, Master!

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:40.910
Yeah? What's up?

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:42.790
This is my once-in-a-lifetime request!

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:45.620
You can cut my food in half!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:48.250
I will dress and bathe her.

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:50.080
I will potty train her!

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:53.330
You can scold me if she causes trouble!

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:58.950
So please... Let me keep her here!

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:00.540
Please!

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.580
Master.

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:12.700
Chocola's wishes are my own.
I ask you, too... Please.

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:20.750
You know, I don't remember ever saying
that you can't have her here.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.660
Th-Then...!

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:26.250
Yeah, as long as you take good care of her.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:29.330
I only have the two of you in this house.

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:34.540
Yes, yes!

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:37.040
Now we can be together!

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:38.830
Yes, yes!

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:42.910
Now we can always be together!

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:21.830
"Illustration by Kaguyuzu"
